<title>UK: Chemring names non-executive chairman.</title>
<headline>Chemring names non-executive chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Chemring Group Plc said on Tuesday that William Barlow had been elected non-executive chairman after the firm split the position of chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>Philip Billington remains as chief executive at the company, which designs and manufactures a range of electronic, engineering and chemical products for use in the military, marine and aerospace fields.</p>
<p>London Newsroom + 44 171 542 4019</p>
